{"id": "10th-u4-q023", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "seyarkai_nunnarivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "edwin_hubble", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1924-இல் \"நம் பால்வீதி போன்று பல விண்மீன் திரள்கள் விண்வெளியில் உள்ளன; அண்டம் தொடர்ந்து விரிவடைந்து கொண்டே செல்கிறது\" என்று மெய்ப்பித்த அமெரிக்க வானியலாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலீலியோ", "B": "நியூட்டன்", "C": "எட்வின் ஹப்பிள் (Edwin Hubble)", "D": "கோபர்நிகஸ்"}, "explanation": "அமெரிக்க வானியலாளர் எட்வின் ஹப்பிள் 1924-இல் பேரண்டம் தொடர்ந்து விரிவடைகிறது என்று அறிவியல் பூர்வமாக நிறுவினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which American astronomer demonstrated in 1924 that our Milky Way is but one of countless galaxies and that the universe is constantly expanding?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Galileo Galilei", "B": "Isaac Newton", "C": "Edwin Hubble", "D": "Nicolaus Copernicus"}, "explanation": "Edwin Hubble proved in 1924 that galaxies exist beyond the Milky Way and that the universe expands."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 76, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 76", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு", "எட்வின் ஹப்பிள்", "வானியல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "seyarkai_nunnarivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ancient_tamil_astronomy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எட்வின் ஹப்பிள் அண்டம் விரிவடைகிறது எனக் கூறுவதற்கு சுமார் இரண்டாயிரம் ஆண்டுகளுக்கு முன்பே \"அண்டப்பகுதியின் உண்டைப் பிறக்கம்\" என்று பேரண்டத் தோற்றத்தைப் பாடியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திருவள்ளுவர்", "B": "ஔவையார்", "C": "கம்பர்", "D": "மாணிக்கவாசகர் (திருவாசகம் - திருஅண்டப்பகுதி)"}, "explanation": "மாணிக்கவாசகர் திருவாசகத்தில் \"அண்டப்பகுதியின் உண்டைப் பிறக்கம் அளப்பருந் தன்மை வளப்பெருங் காட்சி\" என்று அண்டத்தின் தோற்றத்தையும் உருண்டையான அமைப்பையும் வியந்து பாடியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who celebrated the spherical cosmic expansion centuries before modern astrophysics with the line \"Andappaguthiyin undaip pirakkam\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thiruvalluvar", "B": "Avvaiyar", "C": "Kambar", "D": "Manickavasagar (in Thiruvasagam)"}, "explanation": "Manickavasagar envisioned the expanding spherical cosmos in Thiruvasagam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 76, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 76", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு", "மாணிக்கவாசகர்", "திருவாசகம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "seyarkai_nunnarivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ai_robot_ethics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எதிர்காலத்தில் மனிதர்களும் ரோபோக்களும் இணைந்து பணியாற்றும் சூழலில் அவசியமாகத் தேவைப்படும் சட்ட நெறிமுறை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு மற்றும் ரோபோக்களுக்கான நெறிமுறைச் சட்டம் (AI Ethics and Laws)", "B": "அனைத்து கணினிகளையும் தடை செய்தல்", "C": "ரோபோக்களுக்கு வாக்குரிமை தருதல்", "D": "எந்தச் சட்டமும் தேவையில்லை"}, "explanation": "மனிதகுலத்தின் நன்மைக்கும் பாதுகாப்பிற்கும் ஆபத்து ஏற்படாத வகையில் AI பயன்பாட்டை நெறிமுறைப்படுத்துவதே இன்றைய அவசியத் தேவையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What governance framework is universally championed to ensure AI safe-harbor and prevent autonomous existential risks?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "AI Ethics, Safety Standards, and Responsible Governance Frameworks", "B": "Total ban on computers", "C": "Franchise voting rights to machines", "D": "Absolute lawless deregulation"}, "explanation": "Establishing international AI ethics codes safeguards human rights against algorithmic bias and harm."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 75, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 75", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு", "நெறிமுறைச் சட்டம்", "AI Ethics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "seyarkai_nunnarivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "smart_home", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வீட்டில் உள்ள விளக்குகள், மின்விசிறிகள், குளிர்சாதனப் பெட்டிகள் ஆகியவற்றை நாம் குரல் வழியாகக் கட்டுப்படுத்தும் தொழில் நுட்பம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனல் மின்சாரம்", "B": "இணையப் பொருட்களின் இணைப்பு மற்றும் AI கொண்ட திறன்மிகு இல்லம் (Smart Home / IoT)", "C": "ரேடியோ அலைவரிசை", "D": "சூரிய மின்கலம் மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "Internet of Things (IoT) மற்றும் AI மூலம் இயங்கும் திறன்மிகு இல்லங்களில் (Smart Home) நமது குரல் வழியே வீட்டுச் சாதனங்களை இயக்க முடிகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which convergence of AI and the Internet of Things (IoT) enables remote voice automation of household appliances?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thermal power", "B": "Smart Home / Internet of Things (IoT) automation", "C": "AM Radio bands", "D": "Solar cells alone"}, "explanation": "AI-driven Smart Home systems orchestrate home appliances via spoken voice commands."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 74, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 74", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு", "திறன்மிகு இல்லம்", "Smart Home"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "seyarkai_nunnarivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ai_pros_cons", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவுத் தொழில்நுட்பம் மனித சமுதாயத்திற்கு எவ்வாறு அமைய வேண்டும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மனிதனை அடிமையாக்க வேண்டும்", "B": "மனிதனை சோம்பேறியாக்க வேண்டும்", "C": "மனித ஆற்றலை மேம்படுத்தி, உலகளாவிய சிக்கல்களுக்குத் தீர்வு காணும் ஆக்கப்பூர்வமான கருவியாக அமைய வேண்டும்", "D": "அனைத்து மனிதர்களையும் அழிக்க வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "செயற்கை நுண்ணறிவு மனிதனுக்குப் போட்டியாக இல்லாமல், மனிதனின் அறிவுத்திறனை மேலும் விரிவாக்கும் சிறந்த துணைக் கருவியாகப் பயன்பட வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What should be the ultimate civilizational goal of AI for human development?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Subjugating humanity", "B": "Inducing chronic human indolence", "C": "Augmenting human intellect and resolving planetary crises constructively as an enabling tool", "D": "Exterminating mankind"}, "explanation": "AI must function as an empowering augmentative tool that elevates human potential."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational