{"id": "10th-u4-q141", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "valukkal_valuvamaithi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valuvin_vagaigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கண முறையின்றிப் பேசுவதும் எழுதுவதும் \"வழு\" எனப்படும். இவ்வழு எத்தனை வகைப்படும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏழு வகைப்படும்", "B": "ஐந்து வகைப்படும்", "C": "மூன்று வகைப்படும்", "D": "ஒன்பது வகைப்படும்"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண முறையின்றிப் பேசுவதும் எழுதுவதும் வழு எனப்படும். இது திணை, பால், இடம், காலம், வினா, விடை, மரபு என ஏழு வகைப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speaking or writing without adherence to grammatical rules is called \"Vazhu\" (error). How many types of Vazhu are there in Tamil grammar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seven types", "B": "Five types", "C": "Three types", "D": "Nine types"}, "explanation": "Vazhu is categorized into 7 types: Thinai, Paal, Idam, Kaalam, Vina, Vidai, and Marabu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 85, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 85", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["இலக்கணம்", "வழு", "ஏழு வகைகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "valukkal_valuvamaithi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_valuvu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"செழியன் வந்தது\" என்பது எவ்வகை வழுவுக்குச் சரியான எடுத்துக்காட்டாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பால் வழு", "B": "திணை வழு", "C": "இட வழு", "D": "கால வழு"}, "explanation": "செழியன் என்பது உயர்திணை ஆண்பெயர்; வந்தது என்பது அஃறிணை வினைமுற்று. எனவே உயர்திணைக்கு அஃறிணை வினை வந்ததால் இது \"திணை வழு\" ஆகும் (\"செழியன் வந்தான்\" என்பதே வழுவற்றது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Chezhiyan vanthathu\" (Chezhiyan it came) exemplifies which grammatical error (Vazhu)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paal vazhu (Gender error)", "B": "Thinai vazhu (Class error)", "C": "Idam vazhu (Person error)", "D": "Kaala vazhu (Tense error)"}, "explanation": "Chezhiyan is Uyarthinai (human) but \"vanthathu\" is Ahthinai (non-human verb), forming a Thinai Vazhu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 85, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 85", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["இலக்கணம்", "திணை வழு", "சான்று"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "valukkal_valuvamaithi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paal_valuvu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கண்ணகி உண்டான்\" என்பது எவ்வகை வழுவுக்குச் சான்றாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திணை வழு", "B": "இட வழு", "C": "பால் வழு", "D": "வினா வழு"}, "explanation": "கண்ணகி என்பது பெண்பால்; உண்டான் என்பது ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று. பெண்பாலுக்கு ஆண்பால் வினை வந்ததால் இது \"பால் வழு\" ஆகும் (\"கண்ணகி உண்டாள்\" என்பதே வழுவற்றது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Kannagi undaan\" (Kannagi he ate) is an example of which error?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thinai vazhu", "B": "Idam vazhu", "C": "Paal vazhu (Gender agreement error)", "D": "Vina vazhu"}, "explanation": "Kannagi is feminine while undaan is masculine suffix, hence a Paal Vazhu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 85, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 85", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name":