{"id": "10th-u4-q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "valukkal_valuvamaithi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valuvamaithi_vagaigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கண முறைப்படி பிழையுடையது எனினும், ஏதேனும் ஒரு காரணம் கருதிப் பிழையன்று என ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளப்படுவது \"வழுவமைதி\" ஆகும். இவ்வழுவமைதி எத்தனை வகைப்படும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏழு வகைப்படும்", "B": "ஐந்து வகைப்படும்", "C": "நான்கு வகைப்படும்", "D": "ஆறு வகைப்படும்"}, "explanation": "வழுவமைதி ஐந்து வகைப்படும்: 1. திணை வழுவமைதி, 2. பால் வழுவமைதி, 3. இட வழுவமைதி, 4. கால வழுவமைதி, 5. மரபு வழுவமைதி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "An expression technically erroneous by grammar rules but accepted as correct due to special affection, poetical usage, or certainty is Valuvamaithi. How many types exist?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seven types", "B": "Five types", "C": "Four types", "D": "Six types"}, "explanation": "Valuvamaithi has 5 types: Thinai, Paal, Idam, Kaalam, and Marabu Valuvamaithi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 86, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 86", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["இலக்கணம்", "வழுவமைதி", "ஐந்து வகைகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "valukkal_valuvamaithi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_valuvamaithi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"என் அம்மை வந்தாள்\" என்று ஒரு மாட்டைப் பார்த்துப் பிரியத்தோடு அழைப்பது எவ்வகை வழுவமைதிக்குச் சான்றாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பால் வழுவமைதி", "B": "இட வழுவமைதி", "C": "திணை வழுவமைதி (உவப்பு காரணமாக)", "D": "மரபு வழுவமைதி"}, "explanation": "மாடு என்பது அஃறிணை; அதனை \"என் அம்மை வந்தாள்\" என உயர்திணையாகக் கூறுவது உவப்பின் (மகிழ்ச்சி/அன்பு) காரணமாக ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளப்பட்ட \"திணை வழுவமைதி\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Addressing a cow affectionately as \"En Ammai vanthaal\" (My mother has arrived) is an example of which Valuvamaithi?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paal Valuvamaithi", "B": "Idam Valuvamaithi", "C": "Thinai Valuvamaithi (due to endearment)", "D": "Marabu Valuvamaithi"}, "explanation": "Calling an animal with a high-class feminine pronoun out of love is Thinai Valuvamaithi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 86, "